## Easiest Method: Use Cloudflare Dashboard

**Honestly, the easiest way is still the Web Dashboard:**

1. Go to https://dash.cloudflare.com/
2. Workers & Pages → Create Worker
3. Paste the worker code
4. Go to Settings → Variables and Secrets
5. Add `OPENAI_API_KEY` secret
6. Update script.js with your Worker URL

See `CLOUDFLARE_QUICK_SETUP.md` for detailed instructions!

Your chatbot will work immediately after that. ✅
